02:04:59.884 --> 02:05:30.224
<v SPEAKER_11>In this room yesterday we have been discussing between Europeans, Europeans and Americans. We have been discussing and we have been preoccupied with Russia's war in Ukraine. It's it's effect on on Europe and beyond. But we sometimes when we are so fixed, focused on on this conflict, we forget about where how the situation in other countries are.

